---
source: crates/oxc_formatter_yaml/tests/fixtures/mod.rs
---
==================== Input ====================
# issue #25253: a multi-line plain-scalar key re-folds under proseWrap always/never.
# With a block-collection value (hardline separator) the key must flip to the
# explicit form whenever its folded form overflows: a multi-line implicit key
# does not re-parse. `never` folds it onto one line, so implicit is fine there.
sensitive:
  fields:
    ? AlphaLongTableName, BravoLongTableName, CharlieLongTableName, DeltaLongTableName, EchoName,
      FoxtrotLongTableName, GolfLongTableName, HotelLongTableName
    : scrubber: undefinedScrubber
# The key-line trailing comment rides along into the explicit form
? WordAlpha, WordBravo, WordCharlie, WordDelta, WordEcho, WordFoxtrot, WordGolf,
  WordHotel # trailing
: value

